<P class="tit">关于2020级、2021级本科生基础层（C2级）实验实践能力达标测试补测的通知</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2024-04-26&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->&nbsp;&nbsp;(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 13254)</script>)</SPAN></P>
     
    <p>
        <UL style="list-style-type:none;margin-bottom:30px;"> 
            <li>附件【<a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1070628979&wbfileid=DC1E32E90C92795008E27B0EA9B38353" target="_blank">关于规范本科生实验实践能力达标测试工作的通知.pdf</a>】已下载<span id="nattach11929402"><script language="javascript">getClickTimes(11929402,1070628979,"wbnewsfile","attach")</script></span>次</li>
        </UL>
    </p>
    <div id="vsb_content" class="ny"><div class="v_news_content">
